   Technol, Graz, AUSTRIA, SEP 11-14, 2019},
Organization = {Wienerberger; Inst Bauen \& Umwelt e V; GRASPOINTER; BAUMASSIV;
   MARIENHUTTE; Klima Energie Fonds; BECKHOFF; VinylPlus; Schwabisch Hall
